335 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (     After a lengthy search, the company identified a design where the entire structure is based on a tube frame that carries the claw and power system. With this idea serving as the grounding principle, Percy turned out to be lightweight, maneuverable, and easily repairable.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
336 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (     SolidWorks 2023 was the CAD software utilized to design Percy. This software provided opportunities to create, assemble, and test mechanical and electromechanical components of the ROV. Multiple prototypes were developed after designing the Percy ROV on CAD to test and advance through the building process.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
