/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (   With an open-source and versatile platform, the Crush Depth electrical team worked to ensure rapid sensor integration. The current model features a simple yet reliable USB temperature sensor plugged directly into the native USB hub located within the canister. This same USB hub can be used to quickly add USB-capable sensors and equipment. For non-USB sensors, the control PCB features multiple auxiliary power and data inputs capable of running more than twenty additional sensors or auxiliary systems.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
