/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (   Crush Depth would like to express deepest gratitude to the following individuals and organizations who have supported the company throughout this ROV journey:)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
502 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 973 0 R
/ActualText (Clovis Community College provided crucial funding that allowed the purchase of high-quality components such as the additional T200 thrusters, USB cameras, more resilient speed controllers, and high-performance USB joysticks. Moreover, they also granted the company access to 3D printers and 3D filaments for rapid prototyping and production.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [12]
>>
