/ActualText (MATE ROV and the Marine Technology Society special project grant, a contributor to the material for getting started with the MATE robotics competition. These materials include tether materials, a power supply kit for testing, PCB for ROV control, 4 T200 thrusters with speed controllers, and a 20.32 cm watertight enclosure. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [14]
